  "description": "Upgrade your truck with OEDRO Drop Running Boards — the perfect blend of style, strength, and convenience. Designed for the 2015-2026 Ford F150 Supercrew Cab and 2017-2026 Ford F250 F350 Super Duty , these heavy-duty carbon steel side steps provide effortless access, superior protection, and rugged appeal for everyday driving or off-road adventures.\nFeatures\n6-inch side pedals.: The two-level layout provides better convenience for vehicles equipped with lifting kits and oversized tires.\nTri Convex Platform design: The three-tube and tri convex Platform design provides more protection for the bottom and sides of the vehicle while preventing it from getting stuck on the rocker or hanging obstacles.\nBolt-fixed installation: Welded brackets provide extra strength without cutting or drilling.\nStrong and sturdy: The unique powder coating has anti-rust and corrosion resistance, so it can be driven under any conditions.\nTwo-Stair Design for Easy Entry: Features a unique dual-step layout that provides safe and convenient access for passengers of all ages and helps load or unload gear from the roof.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2015-2026 Ford F150 SuperCrew Cab.\nCompatible with 2017-2026 Ford F250 Super Duty Supercrew Cab.\nCompatible with 2017-2026 Ford F350 Super Duty Supercrew Cab.",
